### Backend Components

#### [NEW] [google.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/Yash/Desktop/AGCL/CompailanceOS/backend/src/services/google.service.ts)
- Implement `getAuthUrl()`: Generates the Google OAuth2 consent URL.
- Implement `exchangeCodeForTokens(code)`: Exchanges the authorization code for access/refresh tokens.
- Implement `createDriveFolder(userId)`: Creates a dedicated folder in the user's Drive for the application.
- Implement `uploadFileToDrive(userId, fileStream)`: Streams the file directly from the request to Google Drive using the user's tokens.
- Implement `shareFileWithCA(fileId, caEmail)`: Adds a `reader` permission to the file for the CA's email.

#### [NEW] [document.controller.ts](file:///c:/Users/Yash/Desktop/AGCL/CompailanceOS/backend/src/controllers/document.controller.ts)
- `uploadDocument`: Endpoint that accepts `multipart/form-data`, validates user session, and calls `googleService.uploadFileToDrive`.
- `listDocuments`: Endpoint to list files in the user's managed Drive folder.

#### [MODIFY] [auth.controller.ts](file:///c:/Users/Yash/Desktop/AGCL/CompailanceOS/backend/src/controllers/auth.controller.ts)
